          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni en e makapiny mir awira pa Harun, man makapiny mir awira mi wote, ku kind lam pa Yehova ma jutimo ku mac, i ceng’ m’ethierogi i ie kara gitim tim ni Yehova i tic ma pa jalam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma Yehova ng’olo ya jumi igi m’uai ba nyithindho mir Israel, i ceng’ m’ewirogi. En e makapiny migi mi nja cil kum dhanum’utuk migi ceke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
